{"type": "provenance", "schema": "gw2-frida-array-divergence-sample/1", "question": "dispatch/48：① 两个装配点（0x471a88 副本 / 0x472865 读队列那块）在同一发里是不是同一份内容（差 1 bit 也报）；② `0x472865` 读到的 n 是被谁改小的", "build": {"game": "Graphwar II Linux 2.0.60 (Steam)", "libgraphwarrust.so_sha256": "9a53811518e74b7575c1b9dd1f21cdd1f4f015bfdcd8eaeee4dfdf0bcabed187", "address_space": "RVA = ELF 虚地址 = 模块内偏移；下断 = base + RVA；Ghidra = RVA + 0x100000"}, "hooks": [{"rva": "0x456810", "what": "FunctionPointsEvent 装配（读 pts[len-1].x → end_x）；两个调用点 gw+471a8d / gw+3e44d9"}, {"rva": "0x472865", "what": "execute_results 读 pos = pts[n-1]（rdx = 数组基址、rcx = n*16）"}, {"rva": "0x3c2bc0", "what": "GraphwarShotCalculator::calculate_shot_results [0x3c2bc0,0x3c5c4d)（结果 Vec 的生产者）"}, {"rva": "0x3c2d77", "what": "结果 item 的 push：+0x8 = 数组基址、+0x10 = [rsp+0x1a0]（= 采样器 n）"}, {"rva": "0x3c30c7", "what": "采样器（call *0x9bac98）在这个函数里的返回点"}, {"rva": "0x3c3bf7", "what": "★ 把 item 的 len 改小：mov %r10,0x10(%r14)；r10 = [point_event+0x1c]+1"}, {"rva": "0x3c3c2c", "what": "同一段展开的配对项：mov %r10,0x10(%r9)"}, {"rva": "0x3c50eb", "what": "结果 Vec 的填充（从源 Vec 过滤拷贝，item 的 +0x10..+0x20 原样搬）"}, {"rva": "0x50eb20", "what": "FunctionPointsEvent → JSON 写入器（报文里的 end_x 在这里定型）"}], "how": {"harness": "Xvfb TCP (:117) -screen 0 1920x1160x24 -listen tcp -ac -nolisten unix + mesa-only EGL/GLX", "driver": "tools/frida_point_array.py --attach --diverge --fnpoints --campaign-level 20 --level-node 17", "probe": "tools/frida_point_array.js（只读 Interceptor；`--diverge` 一组新钩子）", "levels": "Level 17 = 战役第 18 关（func=1 即 Ode/DiffEq，散布障碍 + 2 靶）", "positive_control": "装机时 `dvCmpPrefix` 自测：两条 50 点合成数组相同 → diffPoints=0；第 41 点翻 1 bit → diffPoints=1（记在 `hooks` 消息的 `dv_selftest`）；运行期也报得出不同（不同发的数组 prefix_diff>0，见各发 `pos.vs_ctor`）"}, "cut": "per shot: 每次 calculate_function 的 (ret,ptr,n,digest)、calculate_shot_results 返回那一刻的结果 Vec 每一项 (kind,ptr,len,owner)、0x3c3bf7/0x3c3c2c 命中时的 (r14,r10)、0x3c2d77 的旧 len、0x3c50eb 的 16 字节、两个 ctor 喂进去的数组 (len,digest,末点)、0x472865 的 (rdx,n,pos 16B) 与\"与每个 ctor 快照逐点比\"的结果、以及 end_x==pos_x 的判定", "dropped": "beat 心跳、evals/samplers 批量行、整条点数组 hex、reallocs、截图、`--dv-mam` 的逐次页访问行", "no_local_paths": "this file contains no filesystem path and no user name; pointers are ASLR-random per run", "sources": [{"label": "normal_l0_1shot", "raw_jsonl_sha256": "33bc20d1a931a685bb339cfc3cac118637561c366bd916bf74842324fde98640", "raw_jsonl_lines": 42, "records_by_type": {"cfg_ack": 1, "selftest": 1, "hooks": 1, "beat": 20, "dv_csr_enter": 1, "reallocs": 3, "calc_array": 2, "dv_csr": 1, "fnpoints_ctor": 2, "dv_ctor": 2, "fnpoints": 1, "samplers": 2, "exec_enter": 1, "exec_queue": 1, "pos_read": 1, "pos_x_locate": 1, "dv_pos": 1}, "shots": 1}, {"label": "l17_3shot", "raw_jsonl_sha256": "51ff568ab654b5a063a0da595075fe57b6d2c21880f070e546d5e595cbca5a36", "raw_jsonl_lines": 139, "records_by_type": {"cfg_ack": 1, "selftest": 1, "hooks": 1, "beat": 65, "dv_csr_enter": 3, "reallocs": 23, "calc_array": 6, "dv_csr": 3, "fnpoints_ctor": 6, "dv_ctor": 6, "fnpoints": 3, "samplers": 6, "exec_enter": 3, "exec_queue": 3, "pos_read": 3, "pos_x_locate": 3, "dv_pos": 3}, "shots": 3}, {"label": "l17_1shot", "raw_jsonl_sha256": "0e08a60aa5f0de5573704f40dbf4984b713ca7172d2e6b20c844f161bb7cfe96", "raw_jsonl_lines": 65, "records_by_type": {"cfg_ack": 1, "selftest": 1, "hooks": 1, "beat": 32, "dv_csr_enter": 1, "reallocs": 7, "calc_array": 2, "dv_site": 7, "dv_csr": 1, "fnpoints_ctor": 2, "dv_ctor": 2, "fnpoints": 1, "samplers": 2, "exec_enter": 1, "exec_queue": 1, "pos_read": 1, "pos_x_locate": 1, "dv_pos": 1}, "shots": 1}, {"label": "l17_3shot_b", "raw_jsonl_sha256": "d5ff08ecfe5ccc358e6f78605963cc4758655d0888e190fa4bc80829b12d9ecc", "raw_jsonl_lines": 126, "records_by_type": {"cfg_ack": 1, "selftest": 1, "hooks": 1, "beat": 58, "dv_csr_enter": 2, "reallocs": 17, "calc_array": 4, "dv_site": 16, "dv_csr": 2, "fnpoints_ctor": 4, "dv_ctor": 4, "fnpoints": 2, "samplers": 4, "exec_enter": 2, "exec_queue": 2, "pos_read": 2, "pos_x_locate": 2, "dv_pos": 2}, "shots": 